# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
#
# The site is a single-page app with two language routes. "200" means
# rewrite: the URL stays /es-mx/ or /en/ but Pages serves index.html, so
# reloading those pages never returns 404.
#
# Any other unknown path falls through to /404.html (served with status 404).

/es-mx    /es-mx/      301
/en       /en/         301
/es-mx/*  /index.html  200
/en/*     /index.html  200
